        <li>give an appropriate example to illustrate the high reactivity of arylamines in electrophilic aromatic substitution reactions.</li>
        <li>explain why arylamines cannot be used in Friedel&#8209;Crafts reactions.</li>
    </ol>
    </li>
    <li>
    <ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha">
