        <li>outline a possible synthetic route for the preparation of a given sulfa drug.</li>
        <li>identify the starting material, the necessary organic reagents, inorganic reagents, or both, and the intermediate compounds formed during the synthesis of a given sulfa drug.</li>
        <li>design a multi&#8209;step synthesis for a given compound in which it is necessary to protect the amino group by acetylation.</li>
    </ol>
    </li>
    <li>
