        <li>identify the product formed when a given arenediazonium salt is reacted with any of the following compounds: copper(I) chloride, copper(I) bromide, sodium iodide, copper(I) cyanide, hot aqueous acid, hypophosphorous acid.</li>
        <li>identify the arenediazonium salt, the inorganic reagents, or both, needed to produce a given compound by a diazonium replacement reaction.</li>
    </ol>
    </li>
    <li>
